+ * NOTE: six of the seven types live in ../../common/tables.h, which is shared
+ * with db/ and outside this module's remit, so the assertions are gathered
+ * here instead.  packet.h has no #includes of its own and is always pulled in
+ * after constants.h -> tables.h; verified across all 166 game TUs. */
